### Budgets for AI Gateway Resources

Budgets can also be scoped to track only spend through Unity AI Gateway endpoints by setting <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`resourceType`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`ResourceType`" pulumi-lang-go="`resourceType`" pulumi-lang-python="`resource_type`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`resourceType`" pulumi-lang-java="`resourceType`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`resource_type`">`resourceType`</span> to `BUDGET_RESOURCE_TYPE_UNITY_AI_GATEWAY`.

This includes Databricks products that may use Unity AI Gateway endpoints, such as Databricks Genie.

