A per-user threshold applies to each user in the budget's scope. Use <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`principalOverrides`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`PrincipalOverrides`" pulumi-lang-go="`principalOverrides`" pulumi-lang-python="`principal_overrides`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`principalOverrides`" pulumi-lang-java="`principalOverrides`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`principal_overrides`">`principalOverrides`</span> to override the threshold for specific users, groups, or service principals. `BLOCK_USAGE` prevents further requests through Unity AI Gateway when the threshold is reached.

