### Enable the Data API on a Database

Enable the Data API on a Lakebase database with default settings. The <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`parent`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`Parent`" pulumi-lang-go="`parent`" pulumi-lang-python="`parent`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`parent`" pulumi-lang-java="`parent`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`parent`">`parent`</span> is the database resource name; the resulting Data API URL is exposed via `status.url`.

<!--Start PulumiCodeChooser -->
